# Print the pivot table
print("\nPivot Table:")
print(pivot_table)

# Generate a heatmap to visualize the profit distribution
plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))
sns.heatmap(pivot_table, annot=True, cmap='coolwarm', square=True)
plt.title('Profit Distribution by Region and Product')
plt.savefig('output_plot.png')
print("\nPlot saved to 'output_plot.png'")
```

This code will generate a pivot table and a heatmap to visualize the profit distribution by region and product. The pivot table will be printed to the console, and the heatmap will be saved to 'output_plot.png'.

